      "summary": "KEY INSIGHTS \u0026 SUMMARY POINTS:\n• Self-Hosted Architecture: Operates entirely on local hardware with zero external third-party API dependencies or fees.\n• 100% Anonymous: Eliminates login barriers, user accounts, and telemetry tracking for strict data confidentiality.\n• Multi-Modal AI Tools: Comprehensive toolchain covering Image-to-3D, Speech-to-Text, Subtitles, OCR, Translation, and TTS.\n• Automated Data Purge: Ephemeral workspaces and temporary files are automatically cleaned up after the retention window.\n• Real-Time Monitoring: Streaming Server-Sent Events (SSE) provide live progress and worker pool telemetry.",
      "wordCount": 81
