    "result": {
      "outputFilename": "React Components_translated_ne.txt",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "targetLanguage": "ne",
      "translatedText": "--------------------------Components मा React Native-----------------------------\n\n1. Basic UI Components\nView\n\nत्यो fundamental container component.\n\nSimilar लाई / तिर एउटा \u003cdiv\u003e मा web.\n\nUsed को लागि layout, boxes, sections.\n\nText\n\nDisplays text मा / माथि screen.\n\nSupports styling, nesting, र touch handling.\n\nImage\n\nShows images स्थानीयl वा online).\n\nSupports resizing, cacनमस्तेng, etc.\n\nTextInput\n\nInput field को लागि typing.\n\nसक्नु हुनु used को लागि forms, login pages, searches, etc.\n\nScrollView\n\nScrollable container.\n\nराम्रो को लागि small/medium scrollable content.\n\nAvoid को लागि huge lists प्रयोग गर्नुe FlatList instead).\n\nPressable\n\nBest को लागि clickable elements.\n\nProvides feedback मा / माथि press.\n\nTouchableOpacity\n\nMakes यसको cनमस्तेldren tappable.\n\nFades opacity कहिले pressed.\n\nTouchableWithoutFeedback\n\nDetects touch बिना visual feedback.\n\nTouchableनमस्तेghlight\n\nShows एउटा नमस्तेghlight कहिले pressed.\n\n✅ 2. List Components\n\nFlatList\n\nRenders long lists efficiently.\n\nSupports lazy-loading र performance optimizations.\n\nSectionList\n\nमन पराउनु FlatList तर grouped into sections.\n\nराम्रो को लागि contacts list, grouped items.\n\n✅ 3. Image / Media Components\n\nImageBackground\n\nDisplays एउटा image as एउटा background wrapper.\n\nActivityIndicator\n\nLoading spinner.\n\n✅ 4. Layout Components\n\nSafeAreaView\n\nAvoids होइनtches, status bars, र rounded corners.\n\nKeeps UI inside safe display areas.\n\nKeyboardAvoidingView\n\nMoves UI above keyboard automatically.\n\nUseful को लागि login वा form screens.\n\n✅ 5. Platform-Specific Components\n\nStatusBar\n\nControls status bar color, visibility, style.\n\nModal\n\nOverlays content above everytनमस्तेng.\n\nUsed को लागि popups, dialogs, bottom sheets.\n\nRefreshControl\n\nPull-to-refresh को लागि ScrollView वा FlatList.\n\n✅ 6. Gesture \u0026 Animation Components\n\nAnimated.View, Animated.Text, etc.\n\nComponents used को लागि animations.\n\nPanResponder\n\nLow-level gesture प्रणाली.\n\nLets तपाईं detect drag, swipes, etc.\n\n✅ 7. Utility Components\n\nSwitch\n\nToggle button on/off.\n\nActivityIndicator\n\nSpinner (loading).\n\nProgressBar (Android only)\n\nShows progress.\n\nPicker (deprecated)\n\nप्रयोग गर्नु libraries मन पराउनु @react-native-picker instead.\n\n✅ 8. Web/Platform Linking\n\nLinking\n\nOpen links (tel, mail, browser).\n\nहोइनt exactly एउटा component तर एउटा core API.\n\n✅ 9. Navigation Components (होइनt built-in, बाट libraries)\n\nबाट React Navigation:\n\nNavigationContainer\n\nStack.Navigator, Stack.Screen\n\nTab.Navigator, Tab.Screen\n\nDrawer.Navigator, Drawer.Screen\n\n(React Native गर्छ होइनt include navigation द्वारा default.)\n\n✅ 10. Expo-Specific Components यदिf प्रयोग गर्दै Expo)\n\nexpo-image\n\nexpo-av को लागिr audio/video)\n\nexpo-linear-gradient\n\nexpo-checkbox\n\nexpo-blur\n\nexpo-camera\n\n📌 Summary Table को React Native Components\nCategory Component Names\nBasic View, Text, Image, TextInput, ScrollView, Pressable, TouchableOpacity\nLists FlatList, SectionList\nMedia ImageBackground, ActivityIndicator\nLayout SafeAreaView, KeyboardAvoidingView\nPlatform UI StatusBar, Modal, RefreshControl\nGestures Animated.*, PanResponder\nUtilities Switch\nNavigation बाट React Navigation library\nExpo Components LinearGradient, Camera, AV, etc.",
      "wordCount": 382
    }
  },
